{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18395","headline":"闰月定四时 · 许稷","name":"闰月定四时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉律穷三纪，推爲积闰期。\n月余因妙算，岁遍自成时。\n乍觉年华改，翻怜物候迟。\n六旬知不惑，四气本无欺。\n月桂亏还正，阶蓂落复滋。\n从斯分历象，共仰定毫厘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}